   "BURAU REPRESENTATION OF BRAID GROUPS AND",
   "q-RATIONALS"
  ],
  "abstract": "We establish a link between the new theory of q-deformed ratio- nal numbers and the classical Burau representation of the braid group B3. We apply this link to the open problem of classi\ufb01cation of faithful complex spe- cializations of this representation. As a result we provide an answer to this problem in terms of the singular set of the q-rationals and prove the faithful- ness of the Burau representation specialized at complex t \u2208C\u2217outside the annulus 3 \u22122 \u221a 2 \u2264|t| \u22643 + 2 \u221a 2.",
